OL,3,AAs freezing winter approaches, Kyiv
OL,4,Aresidents look for shelter elsewhere
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Russia's attacks on Ukraine's cities
OL,7,Fintensify and autumn's cooler
OL,8,Ftemperatures hint at another tough
OL,9,Fwinter to come, Ukrainians are
OL,10,Fwrestling with how to meet the twin
OL,11,Fchallenges ahead: Russian drone and
OL,12,Fmissile strikes and the biting cold.
OL,14,F"It was a very difficult winter last
OL,15,Fyear in Kyiv," says mother of two
OL,16,FMariia Shostak, who is now packing her
OL,17,Fbags and leaving her small flat.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
