OL,3,AAs freezing winter approaches, Kyiv
OL,4,Aresidents look for shelter elsewhere
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith prolonged periods of sub-zero
OL,7,Ftemperatures and frequent power cuts
OL,8,Fbrought about by Russia's attack on the
OL,9,Fcountry's power grid, last winter was
OL,10,Fone of the hardest so far.
OL,12,F"There were some days and weeks that
OL,13,Fwere unbearable. I started thinking I'm
OL,14,Fnot going through another winter like
OL,15,Fthis."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
